# TailorCV

## Entry

- **Not a top-level tab.** BizStart Germany → `tailorcv` screen (`StepTailorCv` → `TailorCvBuilder`).
- Also linked from `BewerbungNav` next to Lebenslauf / Anschreiben.

## Principles

- Never invent employers, titles, dates, degrees, metrics.
- Output is German tabular Lebenslauf + DIN-oriented Anschreiben (not US résumé).
- Post-gen `validateNoFabrication` flags new entities for user review.
- User always edits before export (drafts → Lebenslauf / Anschreiben stores).
- Privacy banner + one-click `deleteTailorData()`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `lib/tailorcv/schema.js` | Candidate / job / session schemas + LLM JSON schemas |
| `lib/tailorcv/prompts/*` | Versioned prompt templates |
| `lib/tailorcv/api.js` | InvokeLLM orchestration via `/api/llm` |
| `lib/tailorcv/parseCvFile.js` | PDF/DOCX/TXT → text (5 MB cap) |
| `lib/tailorcv/mapToLebenslauf.js` | ↔ Lebenslauf / Anschreiben |
| `lib/tailorcv/store.js` | `scanlogic_tailorcv_session` localStorage |

## Do not

- Put Anthropic keys in `VITE_*`.
- Auto-submit applications.
- Skip fabrication validation after tailor.
- Register TailorCV as a suite `TabBar` tab without product decision.
